## Get all metadata

r[verify metadata-get-sorted]
```console
$ pebbles metadata get 11111111
priority: high

```

## Get one key

```console
$ pebbles metadata get 11111111 priority
high

```

## Getting a missing key fails

```console
$ pebbles metadata get 11111111 nope
? failed
Error: No metadata key 'nope' on issue 11111111

```

## Setting the same value is a no-op

```console
$ pebbles metadata set 11111111 priority high
No changes: metadata priority already has this value

```

## Set upserts (replaces the value)

