## Filter by metadata

```console
$ pebbles list --metadata priority=low
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```
```console
$ pebbles list --metadata priority=high
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓

```
```console
$ pebbles list --metadata team=backend
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓

```

## Metadata filter composes with --status

```console
$ pebbles list --metadata priority=low --status todo
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

