```

## Repeatable --metadata is AND (issue must carry every pair)

```console
$ pebbles metadata set 33333333 team backend
✓ Set metadata: team = backend
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 33333333-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Title: User can login with email and password
Type: Usecase
Status: IN PROGRESS

Metadata:
  priority: high
  team: backend

Created: 2026-01-10 08:00:00
Updated: [..]
File: uc-33333333-user-can-login-with-email-and-password.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```
```console
$ pebbles list --metadata priority=high --metadata team=backend
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓

```
```console
$ pebbles list --metadata priority=low --metadata team=backend
No issues found.

```

